  "reference": "1 Tekwaro 12",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo magi yam gubino bot Daudi i Jiklag, i kare ma piny odiyo ma doŋ pe twero wot ka mo pi Caulo wod pa Kic; gin aye onoŋo gitye i kin twoni oteka ma gubedo ka konye i lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin wegi atum; gin yam gicelo atero nyo gibayo kidi kadi ki ciŋgi ma lacuc ki lacam bene. Gin onoŋo jo pa Benjamin, ma i kaka pa Caulo-gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laditgi obedo Akiejer, ka dok Yoaci gin aryo ducu litino pa Cema me Gibea; ka dok Jejiel ki Pelet ma awobe pa Ajimavet; ki Beraka, Yeko me Anatot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icmaya me Gibeon, twon oteka ma i kin jo pyeradek ca, en ladit ma loyo jo pyeradek-ku; Jeremia, Jakajiel, Yokanan, Jojabed me Gedera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elujai, Jerimot, Bealia, Cemaria, Cepatia ma jo Karup; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elkana, Icia, Ajarel, Joejer ki Jacobeam, ma gin jo pa Kora, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki Joela ki Jebadia, gin awobe pa Jerokam me Gedor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oteka ma guŋiyo ki lweny ma i kin jo pa Gad gugwarre gucito bot Daudi i kakannene ma i tim, oyi ta ma giŋeyo lweny ki kwot ki toŋ, ma wangi nen calo wan labwor, ma gidwir calo til ma i godi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ene: Ejer ma laditgi, me aryone Obadia, me adekke Eliab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "me aŋwenne Micimana, me abicce Jeremia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "me abicelle Atai, me abirone Eliel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "me aborone Yokanan, me aboŋwenne Elijabad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "me aparre Jeremia, me apar wiye acelle Makibanai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Gad magi ducu gin ludito ma loyo mony; ludito matinone giloyo jo miya, ki maditone loyo jo alip. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magi gin aye jo ma yam guŋolo Jordan i dwe mukwono, i kare ma onoŋo piine opoŋ woko Libyeny nio wa i tura ci guryemo jo ma gitye i nota ducu, ma yo tuŋ wokceŋ ki yo tuŋ potoceŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok jo pa Benjamin mogo, ki pa Juda, gubino bot Daudi i kakannene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi okato woko ka jolo wigi, kun waco botgi ni, “Ka ce wubino bota ki cwiny me wat pi konya, ci abibedo kwedwu ki yomcwiny. Ento ka ce wubino ka umo waŋa wek wumiya bot lumerokka, kadi bed an cwinya leŋ, ci Lubaŋa pa kwarowa myero onen ci oŋol gire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Cwiny pa Lubaŋa obino i kom Amacai, ma en aye ladit pa jo pyeradek ca, ci owacci,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Manace mogo gulokke bot Daudi i kare ma obino ki jo Piliciti ka lweny i kom Caulo. Kadi bed kumeno en pe omedo ki konyogi pien ludito pa jo Piliciti guyubo lok i kome, ci guryeme woko, kun giwacci, “Ka ce bidok bot laditte Caulo, ci doŋ wato oke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Manace ma gudonyo bote i kare ma en cito i Jiklag gin ene: Adina, Jojabad, Jediael, Mikael, Jojabad, Eliu ki Jiletai, ma gin aye ludito ma loyo jo alip ma i Manace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gukonyo Daudi ki lweny i kom buca mony pa luyak; pien onoŋo gin ducu twoni oteka lweny ma ludito me mony, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dano gibino ka konyo Daudi nino ki nino, nio ka gudoko cwar mony madit, ma rom ki mony pa Lubaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magi gin aye wel dul buca mony ma guruko lweny ma yam gubino bot Daudi i Kebron pi dwoko ker pa Caulo i ciŋe, kit ma yam Rwot owaconi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Juda ma wegi kwot ki toŋ onoŋo giromo alip abicel ki miya aboro ma guruko lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki jo pa Cimon ma twoni oteka lweny alip abiro ki miya acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Levi alip aŋwen ki miya abicel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok Yekoyada ma loyo jo me ot pa Aron obino ki jo alip adek ki miya abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jadok latin awobi ma twon oteka obino ki ludito wi mony pyeraryo wiye aryo ma i dog ot pa wonne kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Benjamin ma lukaka pa Caulo gubino ma romo alip adek; jo mapol ki i komgi yam gubedo ka cwako kor ot pa Caulo nio wa i kare meno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Epraim gubino ma romo alip pyeraryo ki miya aboro, ma gin oteka lweny ma nyiŋgi oywek i dog odi pa kwarogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma i nucu kaka pa Manace gubino ma romo jo alip aboro ma giyerogi ki nyiŋgi wek gubin ka keto Daudi kabaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Icakar, jo ma onoŋo giŋeyo kare dok giŋeyo gin ma myero Icrael oti, gubino ki ludito miya aryo ki lukakagi ducu ma i te locgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Jabulon gubino ki jo ma gunyebbe ki lweny ma romo alip pyerabic, ma gurukke pi lweny ki jami lwenygi ducu pi konyo Daudi ki cwinygi acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Naputali gubino ki ludito wi mony ma romo alip acel ma gitye ki danogi alip pyeradek wiye abiro ma gutiŋo kwot ki toŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Dan gubino ki jo alip pyeraryo wiye aboro ki miya abicel ma guyubbe pi lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Acer gubino ki jo ma gunyebbe ki lweny ma romo alip pyeraŋwen, ma doŋ guyubbe pi lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace ma gua loka Jordan gubino ma romo alip miya acel ki pyeraryo ma gurukke ki jami lwenygi ducu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lulweny magi ducu gurwayo ma guryeyo kikore, gubino kwede wa i Kebron ki cwiny mukemo keto Daudi kabaka ma loyo Icrael ducu; kit meno jo Icrael ducu mudoŋŋe gubedo ki cwiny acel me keto Daudi kabaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci gubedo ki Daudi kunnu pi nino adek kun gicamo, gimato bene, pien onoŋo utmegigi gutyeko yubbe pigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok jo ma gicok kwedgi bene, ma gua wa ki i lobo Icakar ki Jabulon ki Naputali gucom ki cam ma giketo i wi kana, ki kinaga, ki kana madito ki twoni-gu; gukelo lwak moko kwon madwoŋ, ki poki otini, ki dog tuga olok mutwo-gu, ki koŋo vino, ki moo-gu, ki twoni ki romi, pien onoŋo yomcwiny tye i Icrael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
